I've no experience with this, so perhaps someone else can say 'NO!'
loudly for me? :-D

I certainly wouldn't do it until you have:
A +6-7 weapon in either hand, or a c-corpse
A tin of floating eye meat (To regain telepathy intrinsic after
murder)
Read up about it.  You may need some of the following:
Disintegration resistance (Does this tactic lead to god strikes? Will
SDSM save you from wide-angle beam?  I'm not sure)
A cheap MC3 cloak (elven) to wear while you're doing this if there's a
chance your cloak will get destroyed.  This means you won't have MR.
A death wish

Alternatively, safer but more tedious:
A lichen corpse, pear or (preferably) an apple or carrot
A magic whistle
A pony, horse or (preferably) warhorse
Some source of healing (wielded potions or spell)
A stethoscope is really handy
Time and patience to get the horse to level 10.

So, you can either kill the priest yourself (option 1), or heal up a
warhorse while it's doing the dirty work for you (option 2).

The latter I can heartily recommend, although I've only done it as a
healer, the former I have no experience of.

As for doing either of them right now?  I'd say don't bother.  You can
mess about with this sort of stuff after you've ascended.
